# k.objects/shards/variants: drawings of variants of kinds that look different from their kind (a storm cloud with dark puffs,
# lightning and rain; a rain cloud; a sports car, low with a spoiler; an oak tree with a broad crown; a cherry tree in blossom),
# each with the kind it is a variant of. Parts with a primitive shape, a box in the 0 to 100 frame, a draw order and a colour.
# sources: hand-core 1 (hand-written in this repository)
# license: CC0-1.0
# script: none (hand-written)

